  "properties": {
    "title": "OpenLayers and Vue",
    "description": "There are many ways to include an OpenLayers map into a Vue web application. This presentation will explore a few techniques such as vue3-openlayers, vue-ol-comp, and Wegue. The primary emphasis is on how the state of the OpenLayers map and its layers can be reactively accessed across all components of the web application.",
